   "source": [
    "## Act 4 — Code Overview (Brief)\n",
    "\n",
    "SHAPE has 5 source files and 4 tools. Here's what each does in one sentence:\n",
    "\n",
    "| File | One-line summary |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `shape/agent.py` | Builds and runs the LangChain ReAct agent over Ollama |\n",
    "| `shape/safety.py` | Regex-based input guard — blocks harmful requests before LLM |\n",
    "| `shape/feedback.py` | Rolling reward average from 1-5 ratings → adjusts prompt policy |\n",
    "| `shape/tools/code_executor.py` | Runs Python in a sandboxed subprocess with timeout |\n",
    "| `shape/tools/linter.py` | pyflakes static analysis before execution |\n",
    "| `shape/tools/file_manager.py` | Read/write files in sandboxed workspace |\n",
    "| `shape/tools/doc_search.py` | Offline FAISS semantic search over local docs |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "show-react-flow",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── Visualize one complete ReAct loop trace ───────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Run with verbose=True so the full Thought/Action/Observation trace prints.\n",
    "import sys, os\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath(\"..\"))\n",
    "from shape.agent import build_agent\n",
    "\n",
    "config = {\n",
    "    \"model\": \"codellama\",\n",
    "    \"ollama_url\": \"http://localhost:11434\",\n",
    "    \"temperature\": 0.2,\n",
    "    \"context_window\": 4096,\n",
    "    \"memory_window\": 6,\n",
    "    \"max_iterations\": 8,\n",
    "    \"executor_timeout\": 10,\n",
    "    \"feedback_path\": \"../data/feedback.jsonl\",\n",
    "    \"workspace_dir\": \"../workspace\",\n",
    "    \"doc_index_path\": \"../data/doc_index\",\n",
    "    \"docs_dir\": \"../data/docs\",\n",
    "    \"doc_top_k\": 3,\n",
    "    \"verbose\": True,  # <-- shows full ReAct trace for the demo\n",
    "}\n",
    "agent = build_agent(config)\n",
    "\n",
    "# A clean, single-step demo for the walkthrough clip\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- ReAct Trace (verbose) ---\\n\")\n",
    "result = agent.run(\n",
    "    \"Write a Python function to convert Celsius to Fahrenheit, then test it with 100°C.\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- Final Answer ---\")\n",
    "print(result)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "show-tools",
