    "## Act 5 — The Pitch\n",
    "\n",
    "### What we built\n",
    "\n",
    "SHAPE is a **production-ready offline AI coding agent** that:\n",
    "- Runs on **$55 hardware** — a Raspberry Pi 4\n",
    "- Requires **zero internet, zero API keys, zero monthly cost**\n",
    "- Uses **LangChain ReAct** for transparent, auditable reasoning\n",
    "- Has **4 real tools** that give it executable capabilities\n",
    "- Gets **smarter over time** through a reinforcement learning feedback loop\n",
    "- Is **safe by design** — input screening prevents misuse\n",
    "\n",
    "### Who needs SHAPE?\n",
    "\n",
    "- 🌍 **Field researchers** — write data scripts in remote locations\n",
    "- 🛡️ **Secure facilities** — air-gapped networks where cloud tools are banned\n",
    "- 🎒 **Hobbyists / students** — powerful coding help on a zero budget\n",
    "- 🤖 **Embedded projects** — the Pi is already in the device, SHAPE runs on it\n",
    "\n",
    "### What we learned\n",
